{
  "identifier": "main",
  "description": "The app's own pages in the one webview: the shell (moqui-shell) and the server's pages (moqui-app), which Tauri counts as local alike. Local pages only, never the web. The shell's commands check the page themselves (src/host.rs), so a server's page has the sockets, the outbox, the drafts, the native vault (V5), the web request with a host allow-list (src/web.rs) and the media notification (src/media.rs) only.",
